commit_message:
Add an advanced pluggable rules matcher for Digester.  The original behavior remains the default, but this one can easily be subsituted:   Digester digester = ...;
  ...
  digester.setRules(new ExtendedBaseRules());
  ...

Submitted by:  Robert Burrell Donkin <robertdonkin@mac.com>


